# Root build context — used by the npm-workspace Docker images (synthi +
# mcp/synthi-mcp), which build from the repo ROOT (they need package-lock.json +
# packages/mcp-hub). This file REPLACES the per-package .dockerignore for those
# root-context builds, so it must keep the context lean.
#
# Sibling services (backend/*, ai-backend/*) build from their OWN contexts and
# are unaffected by this file.

# Dependencies + build outputs (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS + tooling. NOTE: .claude/worktrees holds a full repo copy — must exclude.
.git
.claude
.vscode

# Sibling services have their own build contexts; not needed by the workspace images
backend
ai-backend
docs

# Logs, local env overrides, test artifacts, snapshots, markdown
**/*.log
**/.live-test-logs
**/.live-test-artifacts
**/.snapshots
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/*.md
